{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": "ἐμός, ή, όν, possess. Pron. of 1st pers.: (ἐγώ, ἐμοῦ):— mine; contr. with the Art., οὑμός, τοὐμόν, τοὐμοῦ, τὠμῷ, τἀμά, Trag. (not Com., τἀμὰ γὰρ διοίχεται is paratrag. in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Ec. 393", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "), rarely in Prose,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὑμός Pl. Ep. 354c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "036", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τἀμά Id. Plt. 258b", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "008", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; οὑμός even in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 8.360", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; and (acc. to some Gramm.)"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὠμῷ 11.608", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 4.71", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τἠμῇ Il. 9.654", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":—poet. ἀμός (q.v.): with a Subst.: subjectively, mine, of me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐμὰ δάκρυα Il. 1.42", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; χεῖρες ἐμαί ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "166", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐμός τε πατὴρ καὶ σός Hes. Op. 633", "author_abbreviation": "Hes.", "tlg_author": "0020", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": with the Art.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸν ἐμὸν χόλον Il. 4.42", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: in Poets sts. joined with gen., to strengthen the possessive notion, ἐμὸν αὐτοῦ mine own,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "6.446", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 2.45", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δαὴρ . . ἐμὸς ἔσκε κυνώπιδος Il. 3.180", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θρῆνον ἐμὸν τὸν αὐτῆς A. Ag. 1323", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τἀμὰ δυστήνου κακά S. OC 344", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "El. 252", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸν ἐμὸν αὐτοῦ . . βίον Ar. Pl. 33", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". mine, i.e. favourable to me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τεκμήρια ἐμά, οὐ τούτων Antipho 2.4.10", "author_abbreviation": "Antipho", "tlg_author": "0028", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". objectively, relating to me, against me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐμὴ ἀγγελίη Il. 19.336", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸν ἐμὸν γάμον Od. 2.97", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τὴν ἐμὴν αἰδῶ respect for me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Pers. 699", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(troch.); τἀμὰ νουθετήματα warnings to me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. El. 343", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τὠμῷ πόθῳ by love for me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. OT 969", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αἱ ἐμαὶ διαβολαί slanders against me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 6.90", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; δωρεὰ ἐμή a gift to me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Cyr. 8.3.32", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; sts. with another gen. added, τὰς ἐμὰς Λαΐου διαφθοράς murder of L. by me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. OT 572", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τοὐμὸν αἷμα πατρός his blood shed by me, ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1400", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τὰ ἐμὰ δῶρα Κύπριδος (Dind. for Κύπρις) her gifts to me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Hel. 364", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "014", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(anap.). without a Subst., mine, οὐ γὰρ ἐμὸν παλινάγρετον my word,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 1.526", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τὸ μὲν ἐμόν [ἐστι] 'tis my counsel,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. I. 8(7).42", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": in Trag. and Prose, it is my duty, my business,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Ion 1020", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Lg. 664b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "034", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". ἐμοί my friends,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 20.205", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οἱ ἐμοί X. Cyr. 3.2.28", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; ὁ ἐμὸς Ἡράκλειτος my dear Heraclitus,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Arr. Epict. 2.2.17", "author_abbreviation": "Arr.", "tlg_author": "0074", "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". τὰ ἐμά my property,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Prt. 310e", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; of children,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. El. 538", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "OC 922", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸ τύπτειν καὶ ἐμὲ καὶ τὰ ἐμὰ ἀδίκως Pl. Grg. 508e", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "023", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; of servants."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "PEdgar 4.6", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(iii B.C.), etc.; but also τὰ ἐμά or τὸ ἐμόν, my part, my affairs, my interest, οὕτω τὸ ἐμὸν ἔχει things stand thus with me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 4.127", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὰ τούτου μᾶλλον ἢ τοὐμόν S. Aj. 124", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἔρρει τἀμὰ παντελῶς X. Cyr. 6.1.3", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸ ἐμὸν εὖ πράττει Pl. R. 463e", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; in full,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τοὐμὸν μέρος S. Tr. 1215", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": hence in Trag. and , Att. my conduct (almost periphr. for ἐγώ),"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. El. 1302", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Tr. 1068", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Th. 105", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "008", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸ μὲν οὖν ἐμὸν οὐκ ἐμποδὼν ὑμῖν ἔσται Lys. 8.19", "author_abbreviation": "Lys.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "008", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Grg. 452c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "023", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: abs., τό γε ἐμόν for my part, as far as concerns me,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 1.108", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Prt. 338c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Sph. 237b", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". ἡ ἐ. (sc. γῆ) my country,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 6.78", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also (sc. γνώμη) my opinion,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐὰν ἡ ἐ. νικᾷ Pl. R. 397d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; κατά γε τὴν ἐ."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Ec. 153", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Plt. 277a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "008", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "."}]}